      "ImageDescription": {
        "value": "Rolex Submariner-Date model 16610, with a water resistance of 300 meters (1000 feet). The model 16610 was produced from the year 1989 to 2010. The Rolex Submariner 16610 was introduced in 1989 as the successor to the 168000. Since 1999 it is fitted with a SuperLuminova dial. Eearlier watches had the Luminova and Tritium dials. Tritium dials can be identified by a 'Swiss-T&lt;25' signature at six o'clock.",
